ctured approach allows for a clear chronological view of the data around the significant date.\n\nI'll now calculate the cumulative net options position for each set of weeks. The preceding weeks total -2,416 million euros, while the following weeks total -518 million euros. This reveals a substantial difference in net options positions between the periods before and after March 11th.\n\nThe absolute difference between these cumulative positions is 1,898 million euros, highlighting a notable shift in the net options behavior during this timeframe.\n","signature":""},{"type":"toolRequest","id":"call_8491b3b555754df3842e5840","toolCall":{"status":"success","value":{"name":"write","arguments":{"path":"/app/answer.txt","content":"1453"}}},"_meta":{"goose_extension":"developer"}}],"metadata":{"userVisible":true,"agentVisible":true}}}
